 *		Current char	token should contain
 *     -------------    -----------------------
 *		1.  alpha		all following alpha-numerics
 *		2.  digit		0 or more following digits, 0 or 1 decimal point,
 *						  0 or more digits, 0 or 1 'e' or 'E',
